SWE-Milestone benchmark definitions

The task specifications in swe-milestone-{project}.json are reproduced verbatim
from the SWE-Milestone dataset, which declares the MIT license:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/DeepCommit-ai/SWE-Milestone-data
Dataset revision: 3500478e740d42583277c2658aa7729eb36e10f4
Release: v1.0.2

The adapter uses the corresponding upstream harness:
https://github.com/DeepCommit-ai/SWE-Milestone
Harness revision: 17a8f1593e172e26b36cea15e2b30fb9536c93f5

The upstream project's license notice is preserved below.

